#: includes/class-form.php:104
msgid ""
"When a visitor fills in a birth chart, Human Design, compatibility, moon "
"sign, rising sign, Solar Return, Lunar Return or Davison chart form, the "
"date, time and place they enter are sent to api.astroway.info to calculate "
"the answer, and the city name to app.astroway.info to find its coordinates. "
"Names typed into the compatibility form are not sent anywhere. The AstroWay "
"plugin does not store any of it on this site: the answer is not cached and "
"the page is sent with no-store. Security or activity-log plugins on this site"
" may record form submissions on their own."
msgstr ""
"Saat pengunjung mengisi formulir peta kelahiran, Human Design, kecocokan, "
"tanda Bulan, tanda naik, Solar Return, Lunar Return, atau bagan Davison, "
"tanggal, waktu, dan tempat yang dimasukkan dikirim ke api.astroway.info untuk"
" dihitung, dan nama kota ke app.astroway.info untuk mencari koordinatnya. "
"Nama yang diketik di formulir kecocokan tidak dikirim ke mana pun. Plugin "
"AstroWay tidak menyimpan satu pun di situs ini: jawaban tidak di-cache dan "
"halaman dikirim dengan no-store. Plugin keamanan atau log aktivitas di situs "
"ini bisa mencatat kiriman formulir sendiri."

#: includes/class-form.php:105
msgid ""
"When a visitor fills in the numerology form, the name and birth date they "
"enter are sent from this site's server to api.astroway.info to calculate the "
"numbers. The AstroWay plugin does not store them on this site."
msgstr ""
"Saat pengunjung mengisi formulir numerologi, nama dan tanggal lahir yang "
"dimasukkan dikirim dari server situs ini ke api.astroway.info untuk "
"menghitung angkanya. Plugin AstroWay tidak menyimpannya di situs ini."

#: includes/class-form.php:106
msgid ""
"Tarot cards with pictures load those pictures in the visitor's browser from "
"cdn.astroway.info, which therefore receives the visitor's IP address, as for "
"any image from another site. When a spread asks for its reading, the drawn "
"cards and the page's language are sent from this site's server to "
"api.astroway.info; nothing about the visitor is sent with them, and the "
"reading is kept on this site for a day so that the same spread is read once."
msgstr ""
"Kartu tarot bergambar memuat gambar tersebut di peramban pengunjung dari "
"cdn.astroway.info, yang karena itu menerima alamat IP pengunjung, seperti "
"gambar apa pun dari situs lain. Saat bentangan meminta pembacaannya, kartu "
"yang ditarik dan bahasa halaman dikirim dari server situs ini ke "
"api.astroway.info; tidak ada data pengunjung yang ikut dikirim, dan pembacaan"
" disimpan di situs ini selama sehari agar bentangan yang sama dibaca sekali "
"saja."

#: includes/class-form.php:119
msgid ""
"Visitors do not see this calculator: it runs on the site key, so that their "
"charts never spend your credits, and a site connected to an AstroWay account "
"has no site key. The shortcode with the birth data written in still works. "
"Only administrators see this note."
msgstr ""
"Pengunjung tidak melihat kalkulator ini: kalkulator berjalan dengan kunci "
"situs agar bagan mereka tidak pernah memakai kredit Anda, dan situs yang "
"terhubung ke akun AstroWay tidak memiliki kunci situs. Shortcode yang sudah "
"berisi data kelahiran tetap berfungsi. Hanya administrator yang melihat "
"catatan ini."

